| Interest / freshness | 9/10 | Ch. 32, the fire-watch oil slate and proud drawer; Ch. 34, Seln converting the intrusion into “paper” | Bureaucracy, tradecraft, pedagogy, and progression mechanics reinforce one another. The conflict is unusual without feeling ornamental. | High |
