| Character attachment | 9/10 | Ch. 30, Seln filing unchanged reports; Ch. 35, Brom asking “Was he all right?”; Ch. 37, Hesk’s note | Restraint creates attachment. Seln, Cael, and the group reveal values through what they record, omit, lend, and remember. | High |
